<footer class="mt-20 border-t border-slate-200 dark:border-slate-850 bg-slate-100/90 dark:bg-slate-950/80 py-12 text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-400 text-xs transition-colors duration-200" id="metodologia">
  <div class="max-w-6xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 space-y-10">
    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-3 gap-8">
      <!-- Col 1: Project Identity -->
      <div class="space-y-3">
        <div class="flex items-center gap-2">
          <div class="w-6 h-6 rounded bg-slate-900 dark:bg-slate-100 flex items-center justify-center font-bold text-white dark:text-slate-950 font-mono text-sm">
            P
          </div>
          <span class="font-bold text-slate-900 dark:text-white font-mono tracking-tight text-base">POLITICHECK.ar</span>
        </div>
        <p class="text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-400 leading-relaxed">
          Plataforma cívica independiente para el monitoreo y contraste de cobertura mediática y auditoría de compromisos electorales en Argentina.
        </p>
        <div class="text-[11px] font-mono text-slate-500 dark:text-slate-400">
          Neutralidad visual basada en ADR-0003.
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Col 2: Legal & RSS Methodology -->
      <div class="space-y-3">
        <h3 class="font-semibold text-slate-900 dark:text-slate-200 uppercase tracking-wider text-[11px] font-mono">
          Metodología & Fuentes Oficiales
        </h3>
        <p class="text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-400 leading-relaxed">
          Politicheck no reproduce notas completas ni elude muros de pago. Agregamos únicamente titulares, metadatos y resúmenes oficiales provistos por los feeds RSS públicos sindicados de cada medio, redirigiendo siempre al lector a la fuente periodística original.
        </p>
      </div>

      <!-- Col 3: Media Sources Tracked -->
      <div class="space-y-3">
        <h3 class="font-semibold text-slate-900 dark:text-slate-200 uppercase tracking-wider text-[11px] font-mono">
          Medios Monitoreados
        </h3>
        <div class="flex flex-wrap gap-1.5 text-[11px] font-mono">
          <span class="px-2 py-0.5 rounded bg-white dark:bg-slate-900 border border-slate-200 dark:border-slate-800 text-slate-700 dark:text-slate-300">Clarín</span>
          <span class="px-2 py-0.5 rounded bg-white dark:bg-slate-900 border border-slate-200 dark:border-slate-800 text-slate-700 dark:text-slate-300">La Nación</span>
          <span class="px-2 py-0.5 rounded bg-white dark:bg-slate-900 border border-slate-200 dark:border-slate-800 text-slate-700 dark:text-slate-300">Infobae</span>
          <span class="px-2 py-0.5 rounded bg-white dark:bg-slate-900 border border-slate-200 dark:border-slate-800 text-slate-700 dark:text-slate-300">Página 12</span>
          <span class="px-2 py-0.5 rounded bg-white dark:bg-slate-900 border border-slate-200 dark:border-slate-800 text-slate-700 dark:text-slate-300">Ámbito</span>
          <span class="px-2 py-0.5 rounded bg-white dark:bg-slate-900 border border-slate-200 dark:border-slate-800 text-slate-700 dark:text-slate-300">El Cronista</span>
          <span class="px-2 py-0.5 rounded bg-white dark:bg-slate-900 border border-slate-200 dark:border-slate-800 text-slate-700 dark:text-slate-300">Financial Times</span>
          <span class="px-2 py-0.5 rounded bg-white dark:bg-slate-900 border border-slate-200 dark:border-slate-800 text-slate-700 dark:text-slate-300">El País</span>
          <span class="px-2 py-0.5 rounded bg-white dark:bg-slate-900 border border-slate-200 dark:border-slate-800 text-slate-700 dark:text-slate-300">CNN</span>
        </div>
